OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to replace 'Horrible
OL,4,AHistories' roundhouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn open-air museum is looking to build
OL,7,Fa new replica Iron Age roundhouse to
OL,8,Freplace its current one, which has
OL,9,Ffeatured in the BBC's Horrible
OL,10,FHistories comedy series.
OL,12,FThe Chiltern Open Air Museum in
OL,13,FChalfont St Giles, Buckinghamshire,
OL,14,Fsaid the new roundhouse would be
OL,15,Fhistorically accurate, including a
OL,16,Ffloor made of "chalk and cheese" - an
OL,17,Fearly form of concrete.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
