OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to replace 'Horrible
OL,4,AHistories' roundhouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLearning manager for the museum, Jon
OL,7,FGibson, said the current roundhouse
OL,8,Fgave the 12,000 schoolchildren who
OL,9,Fvisited every year "a real sense of
OL,10,Fwhat life was like" in ancient times.
OL,12,FAbout #10,500 has been raised so far
OL,13,Ffor its replacement, with the
OL,14,Fattraction setting a #50,000
OL,15,Ffundraising target.
